    text: "Affected stops:\r\nW 38th Ave & Wadsworth Blvd (#11055) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & High Ct (#10994) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Pierce St (#11038) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Newland St (#11025) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Kendall St (#11006) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Harlan St (#10991) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Depew St (#10980) (eastbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Sheridan Blvd (#11045) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Depew St (#10979) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Harlan St (#10992) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Kendall St (#11005) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Marshall St (#11015) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Pierce St (#11039) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & High Ct (#10993) (westbound)\r\nW 38th Ave & Vance St (#11057) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 38 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 38th Ave & Allison St (#10970)\r\nW 38th Ave & Sheridan Blvd (#11046)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 38 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 38th Ave & Wolff St (#11061)\r\nW 38th Ave & Allison St (#10969)"
